      "q": "1. What is meant by \u2018Second Urbanisation of India\u2019?",
      "a": "\u2018Second Urbanisation of India\u2019 refers to the emergence of new cities and the growth of urban life in the Ganga plains and nearby regions during the 1st millennium BCE, after the decline of the Harappan (First Urbanisation) civilisation. This period saw flourishing towns, trade, and the development of early states."
